{"artifact_kind":"issue_comment","external_id":"issue_comment-4904318296","fetched_at":"2026-07-25T18:35:09.814290+00:00","raw":{"author_association":"NONE","body":"@HoneyTyagii Thank you for the feedback. You're right — `CHUNK_SIZE = 65536` could still hit the limit in some engines. I'll adjust it to `32768` for safety.\n\nAlso, using `.subarray()` instead of `.slice()` avoids unnecessary copies. Here's the updated version:\n\n```javascript\nexport default function binaryToComparableString(view) {\n  const uint8 = new Uint8Array(view.buffer, view.byteOffset, view.byteLength);\n  \n  if (uint8.length <= 32768) {\n    return String.fromCharCode.apply(String, uint8);\n  }\n  \n  const CHUNK_SIZE = 32768;\n  let result = '';\n  \n  for (let i = 0; i < uint8.length; i += CHUNK_SIZE) {\n    const chunk = uint8.subarray(i, Math.min(i + CHUNK_SIZE, uint8.length));\n    result += String.fromCharCode.apply(String, chunk);\n  }\n  \n  return result;\n}","created_at":"2026-07-07T13:27:02Z","html_url":"https://github.com/react/react/issues/36934#issuecomment-4904318296","id":4904318296,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/react/react/issues/36934","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAJy2Ks8AAAABJFH1WA","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":1,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":1,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/react/react/issues/comments/4904318296/reactions"},"updated_at":"2026-07-07T13:27:02Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/react/react/issues/comments/4904318296","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/278171760?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JHON12091986/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JHON12091986/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JHON12091986/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JHON12091986/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JHON12091986"